{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 2, "text": "御览》引《异物志》说：牂柯国“处牂柯江上，因以江名国⋯⋯俗人谓之越王牂柯”。《管", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 265, "w": 1544, "h": 63}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "御览》引《异物志》说：牂柯国“处牂柯江上，因以江名国⋯⋯俗人谓之越王牂柯”。《管", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 265, "w": 1544, "h": 63}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 3, "text": "子•小匡》齐桓公言：“余乘东之会九，兵车之会三，九合诸侯，一匡天下，南至吴、越、巴、", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 334, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "子•小匡》齐桓公言：“余乘东之会九，兵车之会三，九合诸侯，一匡天下，南至吴、越、巴、", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 334, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 4, "text": "牂牁、（口）、不庾、雕题、黑齿、荆夷之国，莫违寡人之命。”注日：“皆南夷国号。”说明齐桓", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 394, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "牂牁、（口）、不庾、雕题、黑齿、荆夷之国，莫违寡人之命。”注日：“皆南夷国号。”说明齐桓", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 394, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 5, "text": "公称霸之时，先已有牂柯国。当时齐桓公称霸中原，周天子派使者慰劳，各国贡献方物，", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 467, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "公称霸之时，先已有牂柯国。当时齐桓公称霸中原，周天子派使者慰劳，各国贡献方物，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 467, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 6, "text": "牂柯国也有所贡献。因牂柯国是越人地区，统治者称“越王”，特冠之以“越王牂柯”", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 527, "w": 1528, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "牂柯国也有所贡献。因牂柯国是越人地区，统治者称“越王”，特冠之以“越王牂柯”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 527, "w": 1528, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 7, "text": "《贵州古代史》说：今乌江以南，盘江以北，云南曲靖以东，从江以西，为牂柯国北境；南境", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 595, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《贵州古代史》说：今乌江以南，盘江以北，云南曲靖以东，从江以西，为牂柯国北境；南境", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 595, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 8, "text": "辖有广西、广东部分地区。布依族是牂柯国主体民族之一。此时布依族社会已经进入阶", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 660, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "辖有广西、广东部分地区。布依族是牂柯国主体民族之一。此时布依族社会已经进入阶", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 660, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 9, "text": "级社会。", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 724, "w": 149, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "级社会。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 724, "w": 149, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 10, "text": "古牂柯国的起源和地域，牵涉古牂柯江。牂柯江有广狭二义，狭义的牂柯江，专指今", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 785, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "古牂柯国的起源和地域，牵涉古牂柯江。牂柯江有广狭二义，狭义的牂柯江，专指今", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 785, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 11, "text": "南、北盘江在贵州望谟县蔗香会合后东流于黔桂界上的盘江（一名红水河），最初独称牂", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 853, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "南、北盘江在贵州望谟县蔗香会合后东流于黔桂界上的盘江（一名红水河），最初独称牂", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 853, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 12, "text": "柯江。牂柯国因兴建在这一流域而得名。江名在先，国名在后。广义的牂柯江，包括今", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 917, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "柯江。牂柯国因兴建在这一流域而得名。江名在先，国名在后。广义的牂柯江，包括今", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 917, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 13, "text": "南、北盘江及红水河、浔江、西江、番禺江等。因牂柯国势力强大后，沿牂柯江上下游扩展", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 982, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "南、北盘江及红水河、浔江、西江、番禺江等。因牂柯国势力强大后，沿牂柯江上下游扩展", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 982, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 14, "text": "地域而得名。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1050, "w": 229, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "地域而得名。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1050, "w": 229, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 15, "text": "“牂柯”（也写作“牂牁”）一词，历代史书形体各异。各书用字很不统一，显然不是汉", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1110, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“牂柯”（也写作“牂牁”）一词，历代史书形体各异。各书用字很不统一，显然不是汉", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1110, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 16, "text": "语称谓。对牂柯的含义，清莫与俦《贞定遗集•牂牁考》云：“⋯⋯牂，读如《诗》‘其叶牂", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1170, "w": 1544, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "语称谓。对牂柯的含义，清莫与俦《贞定遗集•牂牁考》云：“⋯⋯牂，读如《诗》‘其叶牂", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1170, "w": 1544, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 17, "text": "獎’、《尔雅》‘太岁在午日牂’之牂。牁（柯），读如《史记》‘礼器不改牁易叶’之牁（柯）。", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1235, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "獎’、《尔雅》‘太岁在午日牂’之牂。牁（柯），读如《史记》‘礼器不改牁易叶’之牁（柯）。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1235, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 18, "text": "牂有壮大之义，牁（柯）犹木大枝之谓。牂牁（柯）者，言杙牂之大如牁（柯）也。”清《贵阳", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1298, "w": 1544, "h": 63}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "牂有壮大之义，牁（柯）犹木大枝之谓。牂牁（柯）者，言杙牂之大如牁（柯）也。”清《贵阳", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1298, "w": 1544, "h": 63}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 19, "text": "府志》说：盖牂牁（柯）者，本系船之两种撅，牂似斧头，牁（柯）如斧柄。除此之外，还有若", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1372, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "府志》说：盖牂牁（柯）者，本系船之两种撅，牂似斧头，牁（柯）如斧柄。除此之外，还有若", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1372, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 20, "text": "干说法。不管怎么说，基本上都认为它是系船木桩。现当代很多学者也意识到这个称谓", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1436, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "干说法。不管怎么说，基本上都认为它是系船木桩。现当代很多学者也意识到这个称谓", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1436, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 21, "text": "是当时牂柯土著民族的语言，并试图用少数民族语言去加以解释，但因为学者中对当地", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1501, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "是当时牂柯土著民族的语言，并试图用少数民族语言去加以解释，但因为学者中对当地", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1501, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 22, "text": "少数民族语言不甚了解，所以这些解释很多都不太确切，难以令人信服。如果用布依语", "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1565, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "少数民族语言不甚了解，所以这些解释很多都不太确切，难以令人信服。如果用布依语", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 76, "y": 1565, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 23, "text": "去解释，意思非常清楚。“牂”，北盘江一带布依语（第一土语区）读如“浆”，是“粗大的树", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1625, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "去解释，意思非常清楚。“牂”，北盘江一带布依语（第一土语区）读如“浆”，是“粗大的树", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1625, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 24, "text": "干或树桩”之意，“牁（柯）”", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1694, "w": 470, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "干或树桩”之意，“牁（柯）”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1694, "w": 470, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 25, "text": "，布依语念“郭”，是“靠”", "bbox_px": {"x": 535, "y": 1690, "w": 446, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "，布依语念“郭”，是“靠”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 535, "y": 1690, "w": 446, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 26, "text": "'、“停靠”之意。牂牁（柯），合起来意", "bbox_px": {"x": 965, "y": 1690, "w": 655, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "'、“停靠”之意。牂牁（柯），合起来意", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 965, "y": 1690, "w": 655, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 27, "text": "为“船停靠的粗大木桩”之意。", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1754, "w": 519, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "为“船停靠的粗大木桩”之意。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1754, "w": 519, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 28, "text": "牂柯虽然春秋时才见诸文献，实际上建立的时间应当是早于春秋，上限应始于西周", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1819, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "牂柯虽然春秋时才见诸文献，实际上建立的时间应当是早于春秋，上限应始于西周", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1819, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 34, "line_no": 29, "text": "中叶。南、北盘江及红水河流域至今仍是布依族的主要聚居区，历史文献没有发现这一", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1891, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "中叶。南、北盘江及红水河流域至今仍是布依族的主要聚居区，历史文献没有发现这一", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 1891, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
